            "extra": "Run: https://github.com/ROCm/ATOM/actions/runs/33324967949 | Threshold: 0.94 | Baseline: 0.95 | BaselineModel: moonshotai/Kimi-K3 | BaselineNote: Kimi-K3 (kimi_linear KDA+MLA, MXFP4 MoE) native ATOM FP8 kv-cache, TP8 (GSM8K 3-shot flexible-extract). Baseline 0.95; threshold 0.94 leaves ~1pp headroom. Refresh after the first CI run. | Docker: rocm/atom-dev:nightly_202608301440 | GPU: AMD Radeon Graphics | VRAM: 288GB | ROCm: 7.2.4 | strict-match: 0.9522 | fewshot: 3 | Model: /models/moonshotai/Kimi-K3"
