          "distinct": true,
          "id": "e5efbbbe189933379aeed9599e103be1d7a01694",
          "message": "[ATOM][PD][DCP] Support MLA/Indexer cache transfer in P-CPP/D-DCP scenario (#2121)\n\n* feat(pd): transfer sharded caches from CPP4 to DCP4\n\nPlan role-aware MLA and sparse-index regions, staging preshuffled index pages so incremental prefill transfers remain valid for a DCP decode consumer.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* refactor(pd): unify DCP sharded transfer planning\n\nShare one canonical token-ownership plan between Mooncake RDMA and preshuffled index staging so the two paths cannot diverge.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(pd): guard sharded Mooncake producers\n\nReject unsupported DCP producers before transfer planning and add independent coverage for preshuffled index staging layout and tail handling.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* docs(pd): clarify DCP cache region roles\n\nDocument producer and consumer layout responsibilities so the index staging contract is not confused with the removed replicated-cache behavior.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* refactor(pd): harden DCP sharded transfer staging\n\n- vectorize DCP token-run descriptor construction and remove the ineffective sharded-run coalescing pass\n- validate producer and consumer region roles and block widths in the transfer loop to prevent silent layout corruption\n- reduce per-layer staged-index transfer logging from info to debug\n- generalize producer detection so all P/D connectors reject unsupported producer-side DCP layouts\n- derive the staging pool size from configured producer worker concurrency and share the Mooncake fallback default\n- reuse overridable index block sizing and closure ownership for staging allocation\n- remove unused shard-plan, region-plane, and staging-address metadata\n- extend tests for producer roles, staging concurrency, token mappings, and index gather behavior\n\nTests: python -m pytest tests/test_mla_index_cache.py tests/test_dcp_sharded_transfer.py tests/test_pd_pp.py\nTests: python -m ruff check atom/kv_transfer/disaggregation/types.py atom/kv_transfer/disaggregation/mooncake/mooncake_connector.py atom/model_ops/attentions/aiter_mla.py tests/test_mla_index_cache.py\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix: harden DCP PD transfer layout\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix ci\n\nSigned-off-by: Mengqing Cao <cmq0113@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Mengqing Cao <cmq0113@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>",
