            "extra": "Run: https://github.com/ROCm/ATOM/actions/runs/35219985268 | Threshold: 0.87 | Baseline: 0.9 | BaselineModel: openai/gpt-oss-120b | BaselineNote: No public GSM8K baseline available | Docker: rocm/atom-dev:nightly_202609161445 | GPU: AMD Radeon Graphics | VRAM: 288GB | ROCm: 7.2.4 | strict-match: 0.188 | fewshot: 3 | Model: /models/openai/gpt-oss-120b"
