          "distinct": true,
          "id": "614b74d14dbf49fe27cbd222a10868aa857d1a81",
          "message": "[MLA] Add FlyDSL FP8 prefill attention (#2191)\n\n* [MLA] Integrate FlyDSL FP8 prefill attention and fused KV preparation\n\nUse runtime softmax scaling, reuse Q quantization across cached chunks, and consume direct FP8 gather output with device descales.\n\nCo-authored-by: Guanbao Yu <Guanbao.Yu@amd.com>\n\n* [MLA] Unify FP8 prefill controls and keep Triton kernel tests\n\n* [MLA] Make enabled FP8 prefill fail on unsupported inputs\n\n* [MLA] Move shared FP8 quantization helpers to model ops utils\n\n* [MLA] Modernize quantization utility type annotations\n\n* [MLA] Skip fused QKV GPU tests before runtime imports\n\n* perf(mla): fuse K concat and cached KV quantization\n\nRead split NoPE/RoPE K directly in fused QKV quantization and use fused dynamic KV quantization when cached gather outputs BF16. Keep both kernels in triton_fused_qkv_quant.py and preserve direct FP8 gather and error propagation.\n\nValidate quantization, graph replay, prefill dispatch, and attention output/LSE against the existing paths. GPU tests and Black/Ruff checks pass.\n\n* test(mla): consolidate fused QKV and KV quantization tests\n\n* test(mla): remove redundant FP8 prefill integration tests\n\n* fix(mla): check FP8 capabilities before prefill preparation\n\n* refactor(mla): consolidate FlyDSL gather availability checks\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: ganyi <ygan@amd.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-21T20:40:49+08:00",
